CHEAP HINT #2

SEVERAL FEATURES ARE IN THE GAME TO ALLOW YOU TO HAVE AN EASIER
TIME OF IT. NAMLEY THERE IS A NOTEBOOK WHICH YOU CAN CARRY WITH
YOU EVERYWHERE, EVEN OUTSIDE. 

YOU WILL COME ACROSS HINTS DURING THE GAME, EITHER WRITTEN ON
THE WALLS OR IN CORNERS OR OTHER AREAS WHICH WILL BE THE POSSIBLE
ANSWERS TO RIDDLES, PASSWORDS TO ENTER CERTAIN AREAS, OR VAGUE
INSTRUCTIONS ON HOW TO GET SOMEWHERE YOU WANT TO GO.

IN MOST CASES THESE WRITINGS WILL BE OBVIOUS BUT IN SOME CASES
YOU MIGHT NEED TO DO A LITTLE THINKING. THE BEST THING TO DO WHEN
YOU COME ACROSS ONE OF THESE AREAS IS GO INTO YOUR "NOTEBOOK" AND
WRITE A LINE WHICH BRIEFLY STATES THE PASSWORD/RIDDLE ANSWER AND
WHERE YOU FOUND IT. THEN WHEN YOU ARE ASKED THE QUESTION TO A
RIDDLE YOU CAN THUMB THROUGH YOUR NOTEBOOK TO SEE IF YOU HAVE THE
ANSWER.

SOMETIMES...ANSWERS TO RIDDLES AND PASSWORDS WILL BE OVERHEARD
CONVERSATIONS.